!!! Calling something on a type that the type does not declare.
!!!
!!! The receiver was checked -- 'Holder' is a known record -- but the member
!!! never was, so this compiled into a CALL to a function that is never
!!! written. The compiler exited 0, the build reported success, and the VM
!!! reported "CALL: unknown function 'probe__main__Holder__new'" at run time.
!!! An instance receiver was already rejected with "Type 'X' has no member
!!! 'y'"; only the static position, where the receiver names a type rather
!!! than a value, fell through.
book diagnostics.aggregate-member-absent

Holder begin record
    field slot as number
end record

main returns number begin paragraph
    variable held as Holder is Holder.new with nothing
    give 0
end paragraph
